ould be correct to put in this PR. If they are not already reported I will make new issues for them later.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2621233178/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2624534142","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102116#issuecomment-2624534142","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102116","id":2624534142,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6cbzZ-","user":{"login":"Giganzo","id":158825920,"node_id":"U_kgDOCXd9wA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/158825920?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo","html_url":"https://github.com/Giganzo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Giganzo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-30T13:34:50Z","updated_at":"2025-01-30T13:34:50Z","body":"Updated PR with new fixes.\r\n\r\n## RtL\r\nShould now work for column and buttons.\r\n\r\n## Button rect\r\n1. Now works when tree is scrolled horizontally. \r\n2. Height is the full size. \r\n\r\nThere is an issue https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100645 with the buttons jiggiling when scrolling horizontally. This makes the rect be slightly off in some cases. But the fix should most likley be to stop them from jiggiling around. \r\n\r\n## Theme properies\r\nShould account for theme properties now. Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/71997\r\n\r\nNot sure if the first option (TreeItem) should include horizontal theme properties or not. Can add them in if they should be accounted for.\r\n\r\n## Description\r\n\r\nThere might also be a problem with the description, it says: \r\n\r\n> If column is specified, only get the position and size of that column, **otherwise get the rectangle containing all columns**.\r\n\r\nIt sounds like it should give a rect that have the size of all combined columns when only specifing a TreeItem?\r\nThis has never been the case, from what I can see. So maybe the documentation needs to change?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2624534142/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2635777029","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102116#issuecomment-2635777029","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102116","id":2635777029,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dGsQF","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/use